{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13305","headline":"东郊迎春 · 皇甫冉","name":"东郊迎春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓见苍龙驾，东郊春已迎。\n彩云天仗合，玄象太阶平。\n佳气山川秀，和风政令行。\n句陈霜骑肃，御道雨师清。\n律向韶阳变，人随草木荣。\n遥观上林树，今日遇迁莺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}